      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest? i dont know if i can rest. it's more like... when you look out from the edge, there's this strange peace in the nothingness. like the fog is finally clearing because there's nowhere left to go. it's almost beautiful, in a dark sort of way. like the end of a story where you finally close the book.",
